WHAT A LICENCE CARRIES

  A licence names the holder, the place it covers and a licence id. It permits
  a single deployment, on domains agreed in writing. Two terms hold for the
  life of it:

    The build credit stays in the footer of every page.
    The licence id stays in the deployment's configuration.

  Both are how a licensed deployment is recognised and counted.

